{
  "uid": "kestrel-payments-api",
  "title": "payments-api \u2014 is it healthy?",
  "description": "Built from indicators chosen and written down before any threshold existed.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "kestrel-pay"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "environment",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "dev,staging",
        "current": {
          "text": "dev",
          "value": "dev"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "dev",
            "value": "dev",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "staging",
            "value": "staging",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The rate panels below **exclude the kubelet's health probes**. They did not at first, and that was wrong in a way worth knowing: probe traffic kept every number moving, so a service nobody was calling looked like it was serving requests, and a failing readiness probe looked like users getting errors.\n\nWith probes excluded, **zero traffic and a healthy service now do look identical** here. That is why *Targets up* is first: it answers whether the service is **there**, which is a different question from whether it is **succeeding**.\n\n- Up, no traffic \u2192 idle. Normal here.\n- Up, but *Rollout* shows updated below desired \u2192 a deploy is wedged while the previous version keeps serving. Nothing else on this page will move.\n- Not up \u2192 broken, regardless of what the rates show.\n\nNo panel declares a number too high. That is a release decision and it does not live here."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets up",
      "description": "Scrape targets answering. Zero means the service is unreachable, not quiet.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(up{job=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Replicas available",
      "description": "The cluster's own view, so this still answers when the pod is not scrapeable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Versions serving",
      "description": "More than one means two versions are serving at once.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (version) (payments_api_build_info{namespace=\"$namespace\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by status",
      "description": "Excludes the kubelet's health probes. Without that filter this panel reported the probe rate as if it were traffic, and a service nobody was calling looked busy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Share of requests failing",
      "description": "Real requests only. With probes included, a failing readiness probe showed here as a fifth of requests failing, which reads as users being served errors when no user was involved.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\", status!~\"2..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path!~\"/healthz|/readyz\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "failing share",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request duration",
      "description": "Misses the request that never completes: it never becomes an observation, so this can improve as the service becomes unusable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(payments_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(payments_api_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rollout",
      "description": "Desired against updated and available. A readiness failure does not take the service down -- the previous version keeps serving -- so nothing else on this page moves much. This is where a wedged deploy becomes visible: updated falls below desired and stays there.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "desired",
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "updated",
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_updated{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "available",
          "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{deployment=\"payments-api\", namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
